### API Smoke Documentation
### Auth flow: login, refresh, logout
###
### Usage:
###   1. Uncomment ONE @baseUrl variant below
###   2. Send requests top-to-bottom
###   3. Login success sets @accessToken and @refreshToken via response handlers

### ── Base URL (uncomment one) ────────────────────────────────

### Docker Compose (default):
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Local dotnet run:
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:5118

### ── Health ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check — should return 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ── Login ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login with valid credentials.
### Expected: 200 OK, body { accessToken, expiresIn }, Set-Cookie: refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "StrongP@ssw0rd!"
}

### Login with invalid credentials.
### Expected: 401 ProblemDetails, extensions.code: "AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS"
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "WrongP@ssw0rd!"
}

### ── Refresh ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Refresh with valid cookie (set accessToken from login response first).
### Expected: 200 OK, new access token in body, rotated refresh token cookie.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken={{refreshToken}}

### Refresh without cookie.
### Expected: 400 ProblemDetails, extensions.code: "AUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN_MISSING"
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### ── Logout ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Logout with valid cookie — revokes token family, clears cookie.
### Expected: 204 No Content, Set-Cookie: refreshToken=; Max-Age=0
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Cookie: refreshToken={{refreshToken}}

### Logout without cookie.
### Expected: 400 ProblemDetails, extensions.code: "AUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN_MISSING"
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### ── OpenAPI (Development only) ──────────────────────────────

### OpenAPI document — available only when ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development.
### Expected: 200 OK with OpenAPI 3.x JSON in Development; 404 in Production.
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
